"An escape flyer is an Artonan craft for fleeing many kinds of crisis on a preset course."
"It needs no System, and looks like a shiny silver egg tilted at 45 degrees with a clear top."
"It seats one, two uncomfortably, with a luggage compartment and no visible engine."
"It launches like a bullet racing for the stars; one is worth tens of millions."
"Artonan residences, the embassy and some assigned Avowed keep them; infogear fails inside."
